<title>GERMANY: German share market closed Friday March 28.</title>
<headline>German share market closed Friday March 28.</headline>
<text>
<p>German share market is closed on Friday March 28 and Monday March 31 for Easter public holiday. Trading will reopen on Tuesday April 1 at 0730 GMT.</p>
</text>
